stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unconfigured
    Unconfigured --> HealthChecking: connector configured
    HealthChecking --> ReadyReadOnly: health passes
    ReadyReadOnly --> FixtureLoading: local route opened via route registry
    FixtureLoading --> ReadyReadOnly: fresh fixture readback
    FixtureLoading --> Empty: valid empty response
    FixtureLoading --> PermissionDenied: policy response 403
    FixtureLoading --> TimedOut: no readback in budget
    FixtureLoading --> Degraded: provider error
    ReadyReadOnly --> DryRunPreview: local dry-run action requested
    DryRunPreview --> ReadyReadOnly: mutation_applied=false
    Empty --> ReadyReadOnly: scenario changed
    PermissionDenied --> ReadyReadOnly: scope changed
    TimedOut --> ReadyReadOnly: retry with new request
    HealthChecking --> Degraded: transient failure
    Degraded --> ReadyReadOnly: fresh health readback
    ReadyReadOnly --> MutationPending: approved mutation request
    MutationPending --> Snapshotting: idempotency validated
    Snapshotting --> Executing: snapshot confirmed
    Executing --> ReadbackPending: adapter returned
    ReadbackPending --> ReadyReadOnly: readback matches
    ReadbackPending --> Quarantined: invalid or stale readback
    Quarantined --> ManualRecovery: evidence preserved
    ManualRecovery --> HealthChecking: explicit recovery completed
    Executing --> Degraded: timeout or provider failure
    Degraded --> SafeStopped: retry budget exhausted
    Quarantined --> SafeStopped: ownership ambiguous
    SafeStopped --> HealthChecking: explicit restart and revalidation
